<title>POLAND: Polish Irena 1-to-2 share split Oct 15.</title>
<headline>Polish Irena 1-to-2 share split Oct 15.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish glass maker Irena SA will conduct its one-to-two share split on October 15, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The split will boost the number of shares in the company to 6,400,000.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
